  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Cobblemon：簡易寶可夢補給站</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_997832fd-11b4-4335-b260-dea3ebf2cb44.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"404\"></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.7.1-Cobblemon-brightgreen\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/13.0.8-ArchitecturyAPI-red\" width=\"168\" height=\"24\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.21.1-NeoForge-darkred\" width=\"125\" height=\"24\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.21.1-Fabric-blue\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.2.7 -CobblemoreLib-purple\" width=\"165\" height=\"24\"></a></p><p><strong>◽ 你是否曾在冒險途中，找不到地方治療你的寶可夢？</strong><br><strong>◽ 這個簡單的模組增加了寶可夢補給站，提供一些樹果、治療機和電腦。<br></strong></p><hr><p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物之間的生成距離，你必須開啟模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">data/cobblemon_poke_stopsr/worldgen/structure_set/poke_stops.json</span>。在檔案內，修改「<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">spacing</span>」和「<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">separation</span>」數值。<br></strong></p><p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物會出現的生態域，你需要開啟模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt; <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">data/cobblemon_poke_stops/tags/worldgen/biome/has_structure/poke_stops.json</span>。在檔案內，根據標籤修改生態域，例如 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">#c:is_forest</span>。</strong></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模組：</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblemon-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_bc53f78d-303b-42ba-8cf1-432880111c6b.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-pokecenters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a06ced40-ba05-41b8-b825-2c04d21b1daa.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-egg-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_874907dd-1c16-4623-a8e1-b250fa69d933.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-simple-smart-healer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_ef5fb44c-113e-4fe6-a208-3542c670447c.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-poke-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_a1a0d1aa-1c16-461c-896b-f6c3a456c046.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-mekanism-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_26c495f1-de71-4b09-996c-215e2b525d05.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1275153/description_4852adae-28a3-4ef0-80a8-0d59fe2eec14.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p><hr><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1432072/description_047c6a71-dd5c-4c52-af20-72e1ae79f26d.png\" width=\"511\" height=\"358\"></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1432072/description_d236938d-98a6-4f4f-a952-6a789d5fef69.png\" width=\"511\" height=\"358\"></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1432072/description_5af07c36-cc2d-44a5-9a28-9a9fba97d588.png\" width=\"407\" height=\"146\"></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3>模型來源：@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fstyrix%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">styrix</a></h3>",
